WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.844
Prepositions show relations including position, movement, time and purpose; select

00:00:04.844 --> 00:00:06.237
them by meaning.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:11.063
Which shows comparison? “Yaw is taller blank Kofi.” Answer: than

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:16.901
Describe the route to a library and its opening times using appropriate prepositions.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:20.258
Why it works: Than introduces comparison.
